OL,3,AEngland's mayors to be given power to
OL,4,Aintroduce tourist tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to give mayors in England the
OL,7,Fpower to introduce a levy on tourists
OL,8,Fare expected to be outlined on
OL,9,FThursday.
OL,11,FUnder the proposals, a fee would be
OL,12,Fcharged to people staying overnight and
OL,13,Flocal leaders would decide how the
OL,14,Frevenue raised should be reinvested.
OL,16,FThe idea - dubbed the tourist tax - was
OL,17,Ffirst raised by Sir Keir Starmer's
OL,18,Fgovernment in November and is similar
OL,19,Fto a scheme running in Scotland.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
